{{/* @dot donseba/go-webthings-docs/internal/website.DocsArticleData */}}
<article class="grid max-w-5xl gap-6">
    {{ template "hero.gohtml" . }}

<p>go-translator keeps translated text in gettext PO files. Your application supplies a locale through <code>GetLocale()</code>; the same translator can serve English and Dutch requests without switching a shared current language.</p>
<h2>A short path to a translated page</h2>
<ol><li>Create a catalogue for each supported locale.</li><li>Load catalogues and register template helpers during startup.</li><li>Pass a request-local localizer to each render.</li><li>Extract literal keys into a POT file as templates change.</li></ol>
<pre><code>{{"{{"}} tl .Loc "Hello, %s" .Name }}
{{"{{"}} tn .Loc "%d message" "%d messages" .Count .Count }}</code></pre>
<h2>Explore the guide</h2>
<ul><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/installation" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/installation" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Installation and first render</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/catalogues" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/catalogues" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">PO files and language creation</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/locales" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/locales" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Choosing a locale per request</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/templates" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/templates" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Template helpers and formatting</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/plurals" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/plurals" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Plural rules and count arguments</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/contexts" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/contexts" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Contexts and legacy prefixes</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/extraction" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/extraction" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Extracting keys and maintaining POT files</a></li></ul>
<h2>Use it with the other components</h2>
<p>The <a href="{{ basePath }}/integrations" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/integrations" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">integration guide</a> shows the adapters for go-partial and go-form. Catalogue editing and the public methods have their own <a href="{{ basePath }}/editing" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/editing" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">editing guide</a> and <a href="{{ basePath }}/api" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/api" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">API reference</a>.</p>
</article>
